 312:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *
 313:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *  Parameters
 314:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used. (e.g. 0 for "Terminal")
