 316:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    pParamList   Pointer to the list of arguments for the format string
 317:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *
 318:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *  Return values
 319:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    >= 0:  Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Up"-buffer.
 320:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *     < 0:  Error
 321:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** */
