 492:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *          x: Print the argument as an hexadecimal integer
 493:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *          s: Print the string pointed to by the argument
 494:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *          p: Print the argument as an 8-digit hexadecimal integer. (Argument shall be a pointer to
